4 negatives (red until M3): missing capability at throw/call sites; catch/
finally/top-level-initializer outside scopes; spawn's empty scope stack;
--enable-chexc=warn downgrade. 3 positives (green, over-restriction guards):
discharge via try/clauses incl. E1|E2 and contravariant handler, lambda caps
from expected type with capture, default-param scope + function-value call +
main throws. Escape-analysis cases deliberately absent per author ruling
(none before Modal lands).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
